---
---

<section class="section" style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto 52px auto; text-align: center;">
      <!-- Outgriid Eyebrow Pill -->
      <div class="badge-pill mint" style="margin: 0 auto 24px auto;">
        <span class="badge-dot"></span>
        <span>Integrated Pan-African Energy Infrastructure</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Outgriid Majestic Headline -->
      <h1 class="heading-display" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
        Powering West Africa’s <br />
        <span style="font-style: italic; color: #161515;">Energy Independence</span> & Growth
      </h1>

      <!-- Outgriid Body Subtitle -->
      <p class="body-lead" style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 36px auto;">
        Vrosk Energies is an agile, multi-disciplinary energy house operating across physical petroleum trading, offshore STS transfers, bonded terminal logistics, clean gas commercialization, and risk structuring.
      </p>

      <!-- CTA Buttons Group -->
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/our-products-services" class="btn btn-primary">
          Explore Products & Operations
          <span class="btn-icon-circle">→</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/our-roadmap" class="btn btn-secondary">
          Our Strategic RoadMap
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Outgriid Hero Bento Showcase Frame -->
    <div class="bento-hero-grid">
      <!-- Main Visual Hero Bento Card -->
      <div class="bento-card-dark" style="padding: 0; min-height: 480px; position: relative; border-radius: var(--radius-xl);">
        <img 
          src="/assets/oil-rig-hero.webp" 
          alt="Offshore Energy Platform & Maritime Logistics" 
          style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.72;" 
        />
        <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(22,21,21,0.2) 0%, rgba(22,21,21,0.92) 90%);"></div>

        <div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; padding: 40px;">
          <div class="badge-pill dark" style="margin-bottom: 12px; background: rgba(77,255,176,0.15); border-color: var(--theme-color-01); color: var(--theme-color-01);">
            Physical Supply Chain Leadership
          </div>
          <h2 class="heading-2" style="color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 12px; max-width: 580px;">
            Bridging Downstream Supply, Terminal Storage & Gas Infrastructure
          </h2>
          <p style="color: #c4bfbf; font-size: 0.95rem; max-width: 520px; line-height: 1.6;">
            From bulk imports of white and heavy fuels to virtual pipeline gas deliveries and offshore STS transfers, Vrosk delivers uninterrupted energy security.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column Bento Cards Stack -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;">
        <!-- Card 1: Trading Floor Synergy -->
        <div class="bento-card" style="flex: 1; justify-content: space-between; background: #ffffff;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              <span class="mono-tag" style="color: #0d7543;">Capital Synergy</span>
              <span class="badge-dot"></span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Lekki Phase 1 Trading Floor</h3>
            <p class="body-regular" style="font-size: 0.925rem;">
              Operating alongside inter-dealer brokerage and alternative investment partners with over $350M in combined transaction valuation and market intelligence.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(22,21,21,0.08); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--neutral-03);">MARKET INTEGRATION</span>
            <a href="/krosk-partners-limited" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--neutral-04); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
              Partner Network →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2: Strategic RoadMap Teaser -->
        <div class="bento-card-dark" style="flex: 1; justify-content: space-between; background: #161515;">
          <div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              <span class="mono-tag" style="color: var(--theme-color-01);">Growth Horizon</span>
              <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">Phase 1 → 3</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="heading-3" style="color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 10px;">Asset Ownership & Refineries</h3>
            <p style="color: #a8a4a4; font-size: 0.925rem; line-height: 1.55;">
              Active expansion from physical commodities trading into dedicated coastal tank terminals, vessel ownership, marginal fields, and modular refining.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div style="padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
            <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--dark-text-muted);">TRANSITION MATRIX</span>
            <a href="/our-roadmap" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--theme-color-01); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;">
              View Growth Plan →
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
